<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--volt testimonials__eyebrow">Real Athletes. Real Results.</span>
    <h2 class="testimonials__heading">Worn by the Best</h2>
    <p class="testimonials__sub">From the gym to the field &mdash; hear it from the people who actually wear us.</p>
    <div class="testimonials__grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">&starf;&starf;&starf;&starf;&starf;</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__quote">&ldquo;I wore this on the court, at dinner, and back to the gym the next morning. Held up every time. The collar stays crisp no matter what you put it through.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar">M</div>
          <div><div class="testimonial-card__name">Marcus Webb</div><div class="testimonial-card__location">Atlanta, GA</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">&starf;&starf;&starf;&starf;&starf;</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__quote">&ldquo;Finally a shirt that moves with me during training and still looks sharp enough to walk into a meeting afterward. The stretch is unreal &mdash; zero restriction.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar">D</div>
          <div><div class="testimonial-card__name">Darius Cole</div><div class="testimonial-card__location">Houston, TX</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">&starf;&starf;&starf;&starf;&starf;</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__quote">&ldquo;These shirts have ruined every other brand for me. The anti-odor tech is not a gimmick &mdash; I&rsquo;ve tested it. QuillonCo is the only collar shirt I&rsquo;ll touch now.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar">T</div>
          <div><div class="testimonial-card__name">Tyler Fontenot</div><div class="testimonial-card__location">New Orleans, LA</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

